<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>ClarifiedNation – Breaking Barriers Through Sign Language</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@700;900&family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    /* ── CSS Variables ── */
    :root {
      --teal:       #1b6b6e;
      --teal-dark:  #124b4d;
      --teal-light: #2a9ea3;
      --teal-pale:  #e6f4f4;
      --teal-mid:   #c2e4e4;
      --gold:       #c9a84c;
      --gold-light: #e8c97e;
      --cream:      #f9f5ef;
      --white:      #ffffff;
      --off-white:  #f5f7f7;
      --gray-100:   #f1f3f3;
      --gray-200:   #e4e8e8;
      --gray-300:   #cdd3d3;
      --gray-400:   #96a3a4;
      --gray-600:   #556162;
      --gray-700:   #3a4f50;
      --dark:       #182020;
      --green:      #2e9b6a;
      --green-pale: #e6f7ef;
      --font-display: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
      --font-body:    'DM Sans', sans-serif;
      --shadow-sm:  0 2px 8px rgba(14,28,29,.07);
      --shadow-md:  0 6px 24px rgba(14,28,29,.11);
      --shadow-lg:  0 16px 48px rgba(14,28,29,.15);
      --radius:     14px;
      --radius-lg:  20px;
      --t:          .25s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1);
    }

    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    body {
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      background: var(--white);
      color: var(--dark);
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.65;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    /* ── UTILITY ── */
    .container { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 28px; }
    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: .12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--teal);
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 13px 28px;
      border-radius: 50px;
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
      border: 2px solid transparent;
      transition: all .25s ease;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .btn-primary {
      background: var(--teal);
      color: var(--white);
    }
    .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--teal-dark); transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: var(--shadow-md); }
    .btn-outline {
      background: transparent;
      border-color: var(--teal);
      color: var(--teal);
    }
    .btn-outline:hover { background: var(--teal); color: var(--white); transform: translateY(-2px); }
    .btn-white {
      background: var(--white);
      color: var(--teal-dark);
    }
    .btn-white:hover { background: var(--cream); transform: translateY(-2px); }
    .btn-outline-white {
      background: transparent;
      border-color: rgba(255,255,255,.6);
      color: var(--white);
    }
    .btn-outline-white:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,.1); transform: translateY(-2px); }

    /* ── NAV ── */
    nav {
      background: var(--white);
      border-bottom: 1.5px solid var(--gray-200);
      position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100;
    }
    .nav-inner {
      max-width: 1160px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 28px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; height: 64px;
    }
    .logo {
      font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--teal-dark); text-decoration: none; letter-spacing: -.3px;
    }
    .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 4px; list-style: none; }
    .nav-links a {
      text-decoration: none; color: var(--gray-600);
      font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .09em; text-transform: uppercase;
      padding: 7px 16px; border-radius: 6px;
      transition: background var(--t), color var(--t);
    }
    .nav-links a:hover { background: var(--teal-pale); color: var(--teal); }
    .nav-links a.active {
      color: var(--teal);
      border-bottom: 2.5px solid var(--teal);
      border-radius: 0;
    }
    .nav-avatar {
      width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 50%;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--teal-light), var(--teal-dark));
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--white);
      cursor: pointer; border: 2px solid var(--gray-200);
      transition: border-color var(--t), box-shadow var(--t);
    }
    .nav-avatar:hover { border-color: var(--teal-light); box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px var(--teal-pale); }

    .nav-actions .sign-in {
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--gray-600);
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: color .2s;
    }
    .nav-actions .sign-in:hover { color: var(--teal); }

    /* ── HERO ── */
    .hero {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #eef7f7 0%, #f9f5ef 60%, #fdf9f1 100%);
      padding: 80px 0 70px;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .hero::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: -60px; right: -80px;
      width: 460px; height: 460px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(27,107,110,.08) 0%, transparent 70%);
      border-radius: 50%;
    }
    .hero-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 60px;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .hero-eyebrow {
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: .18em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--teal);
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }
    .hero h1 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(38px, 5vw, 56px);
      font-weight: 900;
      line-height: 1.1;
      color: var(--dark);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .hero p {
      font-size: 15px;
      color: var(--gray-600);
      max-width: 440px;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }
    .hero-ctas { display: flex; gap: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .hero-image-wrap {
      position: relative;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .hero-card {
      background: var(--white);
      border-radius: 24px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
      padding: 36px;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 380px;
      position: relative;
    }
    .hero-illustration {
      width: 100%;
      height: 220px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d8f0f0 0%, #e8f5e9 100%);
      border-radius: 16px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 80px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .hero-card-label {
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--teal);
      text-align: center;
    }
    .hero-float-badge {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: -18px;
      right: -20px;
      background: var(--white);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 12px 18px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--dark);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }
    .hero-float-badge .dot { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: #4caf50; }

    /* ── FEATURES INTRO ── */
    .features-intro {
      padding: 80px 0 60px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .features-intro h2 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 40px);
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .features-intro p {
      color: var(--gray-600);
      max-width: 480px;
      margin: 0 auto 56px;
    }
    .features-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 28px;
    }
    .feature-card {
      background: var(--white);
      border: 1px solid var(--gray-200);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 32px 28px;
      text-align: left;
      transition: all .3s ease;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .feature-card::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 0; left: 0;
      height: 3px;
      width: 0;
      background: var(--teal);
      transition: width .3s ease;
    }
    .feature-card:hover { box-shadow: var(--shadow-md); transform: translateY(-4px); }
    .feature-card:hover::after { width: 100%; }
    .feature-icon {
      width: 48px; height: 48px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: #e8f5f5;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 22px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }
    .feature-card h3 {
      font-size: 17px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      color: var(--dark);
    }
    .feature-card p {
      font-size: 13.5px;
      color: var(--gray-600);
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }
    .feature-stat {
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--teal);
      display: flex;
      gap: 6px;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .feature-stat span { background: #e8f5f5; padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 20px; }
    .feature-cta {
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--teal);
      text-decoration: none;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 4px;
      transition: gap .2s;
    }
    .feature-cta:hover { gap: 8px; }

    /* ── COMMUNITY BANNER ── */
    .community-banner {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--teal-dark) 0%, var(--teal) 50%, #2a9ea3 100%);
      margin: 20px 0;
      padding: 64px 0;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .community-banner::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg width='60' height='60' viewBox='0 0 60 60' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cg fill='none' fill-rule='evenodd'%3E%3Cg fill='%23ffffff' fill-opacity='0.04'%3E%3Cpath d='M36 34v-4h-2v4h-4v2h4v4h2v-4h4v-2h-4zm0-30V0h-2v4h-4v2h4v4h2V6h4V4h-4zM6 34v-4H4v4H0v2h4v4h2v-4h4v-2H6zM6 4V0H4v4H0v2h4v4h2V6h4V4H6z'/%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/svg%3E");
    }
    .community-inner {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 60px;
      align-items: center;
      position: relative;
    }
    .community-text h2 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 44px);
      font-weight: 900;
      color: var(--white);
      line-height: 1.15;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .community-text p {
      color: rgba(255,255,255,.78);
      font-size: 14.5px;
      max-width: 400px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }
    .learners-count {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.12);
      backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2);
      border-radius: 50px;
      padding: 10px 20px;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--white);
      margin-top: 16px;
    }
    .learners-count .count-num { font-size: 18px; font-family: var(--font-display); }
    .community-event {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.1);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 40px 32px;
      text-align: center;
      color: var(--white);
    }
    .community-event .event-badge {
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: .14em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--gold-light);
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .community-event h3 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 32px;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: var(--white);
      line-height: 1.15;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .hand-signs {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 20px;
      margin: 24px 0;
      font-size: 32px;
    }
    .community-event p {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,.72);
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    /* ── JOURNEY ── */
    .journey {
      padding: 88px 0;
      background: var(--cream);
    }
    .journey-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-end;
      justify-content: space-between;
      margin-bottom: 52px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 24px;
    }
    .journey-header h2 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 44px);
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1.15;
    }
    .journey-header p {
      max-width: 320px;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: var(--gray-600);
    }
    .steps-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 36px;
    }
    .step {
      position: relative;
    }
    .step-num {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 48px;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: rgba(27,107,110,.12);
      line-height: 1;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .step h3 {
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .step p {
      font-size: 13.5px;
      color: var(--gray-600);
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    /* ── TESTIMONIALS ── */
    .testimonials {
      padding: 88px 0;
    }
    .testimonials-header { margin-bottom: 48px; }
    .testimonials-header .badge { display: block; }
    .testimonials-header h2 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(28px, 3.5vw, 38px);
      font-weight: 700;
      max-width: 400px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .testimonials-header p {
      color: var(--gray-600);
      font-size: 14px;
      max-width: 400px;
    }
    .testimonials-layout {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 28px;
    }
    .testimonial-card {
      background: var(--white);
      border: 1px solid var(--gray-200);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 28px 26px;
      transition: box-shadow .25s;
    }
    .testimonial-card:hover { box-shadow: var(--shadow-md); }
    .stars {
      font-size: 15px;
      color: var(--gold);
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }
    .testimonial-card blockquote {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: var(--gray-600);
      line-height: 1.7;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      font-style: italic;
    }
    .reviewer {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
    }
    .reviewer-avatar {
      width: 38px; height: 38px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--teal-light), var(--teal-dark));
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--white);
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .reviewer-name { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; }
    .reviewer-title { font-size: 12px; color: var(--gray-400); }

    /* ── CTA SECTION ── */
    .cta-section {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--teal-dark) 0%, #0e3d3f 100%);
      padding: 88px 0;
      text-align: center;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .cta-section::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: -100px; left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      width: 700px; height: 700px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(201,168,76,.12) 0%, transparent 65%);
      border-radius: 50%;
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .cta-section h2 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 52px);
      font-weight: 900;
      color: var(--white);
      line-height: 1.15;
      max-width: 560px;
      margin: 0 auto 16px;
    }
    .cta-section p {
      color: rgba(255,255,255,.68);
      font-size: 15px;
      max-width: 420px;
      margin: 0 auto 36px;
    }
    .cta-btns { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap; }

    /* ── FOOTER ── */
    footer {
      background: var(--dark);
      color: rgba(255,255,255,.55);
      padding: 40px 0;
    }
    .footer-inner {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 20px;
    }
    .footer-logo {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--white);
    }
    .footer-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 28px;
      list-style: none;
    }
    .footer-links a {
      color: rgba(255,255,255,.5);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 13px;
      transition: color .2s;
    }
    .footer-links a:hover { color: var(--white); }
    .footer-copy { font-size: 12px; }

    /* ── ANIMATIONS ── */
    @keyframes fadeUp {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(24px); }
      to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }
    .hero-text > * { animation: fadeUp .6s ease both; }
    .hero-eyebrow  { animation-delay: .05s; }
    .hero h1       { animation-delay: .15s; }
    .hero p        { animation-delay: .25s; }
    .hero-ctas     { animation-delay: .35s; }
    .hero-image-wrap { animation: fadeUp .7s .3s ease both; }

    /* ── RESPONSIVE ── */
    @media (max-width: 860px) {
      .hero-grid,
      .community-inner,
      .testimonials-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .hero-image-wrap { order: -1; }
      .features-grid,
      .steps-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
      .nav-links { display: none; }
      .journey-header { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 560px) {
      .features-grid,
      .steps-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .footer-inner { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ── NAVBAR ── -->
<nav>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="nav-inner">
      <a href="/" class="logo">Clarified Horizon</a>
        <ul class="nav-links">
          <li><a href="/" class="active">HOME</a></li>
          <li><a href="/learn">LEARN</a></li>
          <li><a href="/translate">TRANSLATE</a></li>
        </ul>
      <div class="nav-actions">
        <a href="/signin" class="sign-in">Sign In</a>
        <a href="/learn" class="btn btn-primary">Get Started</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>

<!-- ── HERO ── -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="hero-grid">
      <div class="hero-text">
        <div class="hero-eyebrow">Empowering Communication</div>
        <h1>Breaking Barriers<br>Through Sign<br>Language.</h1>
        <p>Learn American Sign Language to find and express yourself with our AI-powered platform designed for clarity and connection.</p>
        <div class="hero-ctas">
          <a href="/learn" class="btn btn-primary">Get Started For Free →</a>
          <a href="#" class="btn btn-outline">▶ Watch Demo</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-image-wrap">
        <div class="hero-card">
          <div class="hero-illustration">🤟</div>
          <div class="hero-card-label">Real-Time Sign Detection Active</div>
          <div class="hero-float-badge">
            <span class="dot"></span>
            AI Analyzing Sign…
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ── FEATURES ── -->
<section class="features-intro">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="badge">Capabilities</div>
    <h2>Intelligence Meets Expression</h2>
    <p>Three core pillars that power your learning journey from first gesture to fluent conversation.</p>
    <div class="features-grid">

      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">⚡</div>
        <h3>Real-Time Translation</h3>
        <p>Translate in real time from hand gestures to instant text and speech. Our proprietary AI understands context, not just isolated signs.</p>
        <div class="feature-stat"><span>99% Accuracy</span> <span>Real-Time</span></div>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">🎓</div>
        <h3>Interactive Learning</h3>
        <p>Master ASL with personalized, interactive courses that provide real feedback on your signs as you practice each lesson.</p>
        <a href="/learn" class="feature-cta">Start Learning →</a>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">🌐</div>
        <h3>Community Support</h3>
        <p>Connect with a global community of learners and experts. Participate in workshops and peer reviews to accelerate growth.</p>
        <div class="feature-stat"><span>50,000+ Members</span></div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<!-- ── JOURNEY ── -->
<section class="journey">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="journey-header">
      <div>
        <div class="badge">The Journey</div>
        <h2>Simplicity in Motion</h2>
      </div>
      <p>Your path to fluency is structured and supported every step of the way.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="steps-grid">
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">01</div>
        <h3>Choose your path</h3>
        <p>Whether you are a complete beginner looking for the basics, or a teacher expanding your signing vocabulary — we have a track for you.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">02</div>
        <h3>Practice with AI</h3>
        <p>Our camera-based AI gives you real-time feedback on hand shape, position, and motion so you can improve with every repetition.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">03</div>
        <h3>Connect &amp; Communicate</h3>
        <p>Apply your skills in real-world scenarios and join our community to build confidence using sign language every day.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

